/-- `Enc` of a model built by `mk`, from its `A` and `R` obligations (variable coefficients, so the
`st` field is checked without reducing any arithmetic on literals) -/
theorem mk_enc {f : (Fin 4 → ℝ) → ℝ} (c0 c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 c7 c8 c9 c10 c11 c12 c13 c14 c15 c16 c17 c18 c19 c20 c21 c22 c23 : ℕ) (R : I) (A : ℕ) (ok : Bool)
